# Store every text file with LF in the repository regardless of the platform it
# was authored on. Without this, a Windows checkout under `core.autocrlf=true`
# produces a CRLF working tree that `pnpm verify` fails on, because Prettier
# defaults to LF. `.prettierrc.json` sets `endOfLine: auto` so the check also
# passes on a clone made before this file existed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
